        <p>This match was played at Rochdale, Wore 5,000 spectators. The Hornets were strongly represented,but Swinton were without Hampson, Morgan, and Valentine. Fl ii turned ow: for the first time this season with the Hornets. Swinton, one goal and one try (five points) ; Rochdale hornets, nothing.</p>
