        <p>St. Pster'e C.A. v. Warrington United.</p>
        <p>This match was playel on the ground of the former on S.tarday, in beaut fin weather. Ralf-time :—St Perm's C A , 3 goal., Warrington United, 0. Final :- 8; Peter's, 4 goals, Warrington United, 1 Wilderspool Central v Lovely-lane.</p>
        <p>At Lovely-lane. The homesters started and by good passing got near the visitors goal. The attack was repulsed however and the Central got to the other end</p>
