      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1901-10-25_WidnesExaminer_art0085" n="art0085">
        <head>VIOLENT HEADACHES.</head>
        <p>VIOLENT HEADACHES.</p>
        <p>Mr. Joseph Tannicliffe, of Burton Agn.s, Bridlington, is to-day strong and healthy. Be had suffered from violent headaches and pains throughout his body and limbs. "I was afraid my heart was affected," be says, "as at times I was hardly atle to gct my breath, it causing me so much pain." Mr. Tunnicliffe was examined by five different doc- tors, tut got no better, and his relatives despaired of ever seeing him well again. He, however, began to take Dodd's Kidney Pills, with astonishing results both to his friends and to himself. Before he had taken many doses the pain left him, and he is now able to got to his work again. Be says he is now strong and healthy, and feels like a new man. Mr. Tunnicliftes trouble was his kidneys. The distressing symptoms from which he suffered were due to them tailing to re- move the poisons which the body gives off, and which remained to pollute the blood. lie took the perfect kidney remedy; Dodd's Kidney Pills, and by curing the kidney., cured the other bodily ailments. Dodd's Kidney Pills are 2s. 9d per boa, of all chemists, or post free on receipt of price by Tbe Dodds Medicine Co., 23, Farrinordon-ivenue, London, E.C. Remember the name, D-o-d-d-'s.</p>
